"entry","statement":"The declared entry is POST /process/file, implemented by process_file.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-a138c442b21f885c","startLine":1546,"endLine":1552}]},{"id":"f-principal-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"For a non-admin caller, process_file retrieves the file only by matching the supplied file_id with user.id.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-a138c442b21f885c","startLine":1559,"endLine":1563}]},{"id":"f-resource-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The endpoint accepts a caller-supplied collection_name and retains it as the destination collection name.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-a138c442b21f885c","startLine":1540,"endLine":1544},{"sourceId":"src-a138c442b21f885c","startLine":1565,"endLine":1570}]},{"id":"f-source-content","kind":"condition","statement":"When collection_name is supplied, the handler obtains the file content from the existing file vector collection or file data and constructs docs containing that content.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-a138c442b21f885c","startLine":1595,"endLine":1626}]},{"id":"f-authorization-control","kind":"control","statement":"The visible authorization control verifies access to the source file through the non-admin file_id-and-user_id lookup; the supplied source contains no destination ownership or explicit destination write-grant check before the save helper is called.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-a138c442b21f885c","startLine":1559,"endLine":1563},{"sourceId":"src-a138c442b21f885c","startLine":1694,"endLine":1705}]},{"id":"f-destination-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"save_docs_to_vector_db reaches VECTOR_DB_CLIENT.insert using the caller-selected collection_name and the prepared document items.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-a138c442b21f885c","startLine":1517,"endLine":1533}]},{"id":"f-existing-collection-path","kind":"condition","statement":"The save helper detects that the selected collection exists and, because add is true for a supplied collection_name, does not return at the existing-collection early exit and proceeds toward insertion.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-a138c442b21f885c","startLine":1458,"endLine":1467},{"sourceId":"src-a138c442b21f885c","startLine":1694,"endLine":1705}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":6588,"output":934,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":38227.9655,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-28T17:56:12.632Z"}}
